"You just deleted the form's content host (Surface) — and with it every control it hosted.\n"
"\n"
"Press Ctrl+Z to undo.\n"
"\n"
"If undo does not restore it, close this form WITHOUT saving and reopen it — the Surface is not on the component palette, so it cannot be dropped back."
